["Sensei_remembers1"]="I remembered something more, shall we return to my story?",
["Sensei_remembers0"]="This city awakens some memories. I will tell you my story that happened many years ago...",
["ActScreenSensei6"]="Sensei's Story{br}Part 6. The Monster",
["ActScreenSensei5"]="Sensei's Story{br}Part 5. Humiliated and Insulted",
["ActScreenSensei4"]="Sensei's Story{br}Part 4. The Story of Revenge",
["ActScreenSensei3"]="Sensei's Story{br}Part 3. The Beast Within",
["ActScreenSensei2"]="Sensei's Story{br}Part 2. Shadow of the Future",
