["Sensei_arc_Title"]="Old Wounds",
["Sensei_arc"]="OLD WOUNDS",
["Sensei_button_locked_desc"]="Complete 3 tournament fights and previous parts of Sensei's story to unlock this battle",
["Sensei_defeat5"]="No, it wasn’t that way. It seems like I won then... likely.",
["Sensei_defeat4"]="My memories are so vague... I think I won that fight.",
["Sensei_defeat3"]="I think that wasn’t how that fight ended. Let me try to recall it...",
["Sensei_defeat2"]="I think it happened another way... Memories can be very fragile.",
["Sensei_defeat1"]="No, wait... It didn’t happen that way... Please forgive the old man’s forgetfulness.",
["Zone6_SenseiReminder"]="The magical Sphere made Prince mad! It gave him imminent power... that threatened to destroy us all! I couldn’t allow that to happen.",
["Zone5_SenseiReminder"]="The pirate girl told me about Widow’s complicated story with Prince. I didn’t get the Sphere, but learn that Prince went to the mountains to find Widow.",
["Zone4_SenseiReminder"]="Prince’s troubles were caused by a woman! She devised a plan to overthrow him by using a magical Sphere which was now brought to the nearby port...",
["Zone3_SenseiReminder"]="The Hermit told us that Prince’s warlord, Shogun, betrayed his lord and paid a certain Butcher to kidnap him. It was now time to visit the bandit.",
["Zone2_SenseiReminder"]="Last time I was telling you how I’ve saved Prince from killers. I’ve learnt that a Hermit was secretly training his soldiers. So that was where we went.",
["Ancient_zone6_2"]="Change is imminent, human. For now, sleep. When you wake up, no one will remember your feat. It needs to be that way. One day you shall understand...",
["Sensei_zone6_2"]="Wait! I have so many questions! Who are you? What is there, behind the Gates? I want to know...",
["Ancient_zone6_1"]="You’re not dreaming. I’ve stopped the time to take the Sphere back to the shadow. Its presence here was a mistake caused by the instability of the Gates of Shadows.",
["Prince_zone6_2"]="You, too, old man, want to claim my throne?! I own it by birthright! No one shall take it from me!",
["Sensei_zone6_1"]="Prince, stop! Look around! The Sphere is feeding upon your anger, turning you into a monster!",
["Shogun_zone6_1"]="Weakling! You’re not even good enough to be my lord’s court jester. I’ll crush you with a single blow!",
["Prince_zone6_1"]="Here you are, my loyal friend! Look—justice triumphs again, Shogun is my faithful dog. His mind is mine!",
["Widow_zone5_4"]="I’ve never seen Prince so... wild. His eyes were flaming! He thought it to be funny to execute a traitor in the place where we first met. I’ll show you...",
["Widow_zone5_3"]="There is no way back for me. I see that you want to help, but it’s too late—Prince took the Sphere already. Shogun was trying to defend it, but in vain.",
["Sensei_zone5_1"]="I sympathize with you, I truly do. But a broken heart is a poor advisor. Please understand: there are people suffering because of you.",
["WidowYoung_Greetings"]="Prince humiliated me by rejecting and laughing at my feelings. Now I shall strike back! You are his friend, so you’ll deliver this message to him...",
["Guard2_Widow_Sensei"]="My lady is so fair! I was unworthy of seeing her face... Now my life belongs to her. I will protect her honor till my last breath.",
["Guard1_Widow_Sensei"]="My lady is like a sister to me. I can feel her pain. She forbids me from touching Prince, thus my anger shall fall upon you!",
["Widow_zone5_2"]="He’s been telling me of your kindness, honor, and dignity. But I don’t believe any male’s words any more. Each of you shall suffer!",
["Widow_zone5_1"]="Are you coming to humiliate me the way Prince did? You males are all the same...",
["Sensei_zone4_2"]="We must stop Prince before he finds Widow... and the Sphere...",
["Wasp_zone4_5"]="Widow wants to rule men and to play them off one against another. The Sphere shall make her chosen one great... and absolutely loyal to her.",
["Wasp_zone4_4"]="Widow loved Prince, but he rejected her. Then she found herself a new toy: Shogun. The hag is using the stupid warlord for her revenge.",
["Wasp_zone4_3"]="Stop—I’ve underestimated you, ol’ man! I’ve been paid for delivery, but I got no business fighting for Widow’s honor. I’ll show you to her hiding place!",
["WaspYoung_Greetings"]="What shall I tell my father? His daughter having melted and losing a fight to an old man? That ain’t gonna happen as long as I’m the heir to the pirates’ throne!",
["Guard2_Wasp_Sensei"]="Threatening my captain? She saved me from thralldom, and I swore to work off my freedom. Let the spirits be kind to you...",
["Guard1_Wasp_Sensei"]="Do you believe in fortune? I think I gonna make my fortune today by takin’ all yer monies. You think you’ll have some luck, ol’ man?",
["Wasp_zone4_2"]="Thing is that I don’t have the Sphere any more. Widow’s men took it yesterday. Dunno who you are, but I never forgive liars. Keelhaul ‘im!",
["Sensei_zone4_1"]="Widow? Of course... she told me to take the Sphere and bring it to Shogun, into his own hands.",
["Wasp_zone4_1"]="Widow sends you to take the Sphere? Aren’t you a bit too old for jobs like that? Ah, why should I care. Get on board.",
["Butcher_zone3_6"]="Go to the port. Shogun is waiting for a ship to arrive, bringing the Sphere. It is Prince’s last chance to reclaim his throne.",
["Butcher_zone3_5"]="A certain woman convinced Shogun that the throne is his by right. She promised he'll have the Sphere, becoming a great warlord. All that for being her liege.",
["Butcher_zone3_4"]="I know that as soon as Prince draws his last breath, Shogun won’t let me live. I’m just a tool; I am expendable. So—I shall help you.",
["Sensei_zone3_2"]="Answer me, why does Shogun want him dead, and what is the magic Sphere you were talking about?",
["Butcher_zone3_3"]="Hee-hee! Look at Prince taking to his heels! You should’ve seen your face, old man. See—your new friend is a spineless liar!",
["ButcherYoung_Greetings"]="Nobody dares to doubt my authority! The family never forgives that. You’re not leaving alive!",
["Guard2_Butcher_Sensei"]="The game comes into the bag! Philosophy is for dorks—as for me, I just like playing with knives. Wanna play with me?",
["Guard1_Butcher_Sensei"]="Butcher showed me how pain reveals our true self. I am free now! You can find happiness, too. Do not resist!",
["Butcher_zone3_2"]="His silence is louder than words, old man. Me—I’m honest with myself, adopting my bestial nature. He’s not. But we shall teach you humility! Come, children!",
["Sensei_zone3_1"]="So this is what “luck” means? Buying your freedom, and feeding your people to a gang of madmen... And I was so kind towards you, prince.",
["Prince_zone3_1"]="How dare you soiling my name! You... you miserable wretch! I’m back to put an end to your reign of cruelty!",
["Butcher_zone3_1"]="The prodigal son is back! Have you considered my proposal, Prince—that of my letting you go and telling the whereabouts of the Sphere, and you paying me gold?",
["Hermit_zone2_4"]="Butcher dwells with his gang not far from here. They were your kidnappers, sire. Go—I wish you finding your answers.",
["Prince_zone2_1"]="MY men! Placing him at the head of my army was a mistake... If you still have at least a mite of honor, tell us where the bandits’ camp is!",
["Hermit_zone2_3"]="Try to understand: our art is at it’s end! In order to survive it needs to change. I know how. And Shogun promised me protection for training his men.",
["Sensei_zone2_1"]="Shame on you! Selling your honor outright! And what for? Do you think people shall follow a traitor’s lead? Is that a good example for the young?",
["HermitYoung_Greetings"]="You’re a victim of circumstances, Prince, a sacrifice needed for common good. My school shall attain greatness, and the golden age of martial arts shall begin!",
["Guard2_Hermit_Sensei"]="Master told us about the world of shadows, about its dwellers and its imminent powers he’ll share with us. Do you think I’ll let you take this all from us?",
["Guard1_Hermit_Sensei"]="Change is imminent! I’ve crossed half the world to learn it, sacrificed so much... Master’s wisdom is all that I have!",
["Hermit_zone2_2"]="Lynx, this arrogant youth, hasn’t coped with his task. I’ll have to do his job. Disciples, front and center!",
["Hermit_zone2_1"]="You are between a rock and a hard place, my lord. I admit having betrayed you. I had no choice though, for the future of my school is at stake.",
["Sensei_zone1_1"]="Too many coincidences. Someone knew of our visit, and warned the bandits. But how is the Hermit involved? We have to learn this. Let’s go!",
["Prince_zone1_3"]="I took a unit of men to him in order to make things clear, but I was taken captive. However, luck was still on my side, and I could escape.",
["Prince_zone1_2"]="I’ve learnt something I wasn’t supposed to: my soldiers study forbidden practices under a certain Hermit. They wanted to remove me as a witness...",
["Prince_zone1_1"]="Thank you! You’ve noble, for few would stand up for someone they don’t know. I thought death was near, for these people know nothing of mercy.",
["LynxYoung_Greetings"]="I can’t just leave. I’ve already been paid for Prince’s life. Nothing personal here, old man.",
["Guard2_Lynx_Sensei"]="Our clan does work that is too dirty even for the gods. We solve problems and correct others’ mistakes. And you are one of these.",
["Guard1_Lynx_Sensei"]="Do you like my tattoos? In the land where I was born the strongest get such as souvenirs of their feats. You’ll soon be part of the picture, too...",
["Lynx_Sensei_3"]="Do what you want. They don't pay me for talking. Two heads means more money. Get them, boys!",
["Lynx_Sensei_2"]="Really? For what I see is a frightened man surrounded by cutthroats. Something suggests that the Prince is telling the truth. Step away from him!",
["Lynx_Sensei_1"]="Don’t listen to Prince, old man, he just went mad. We’re taking His Highness home before he hurts himself.  Your help is not required.",
["Prince_Intro"]="Help! These people want to kill me!",
["Sensei_arc_intro1"]="Once upon a time, I was taking a walk and met the local lord who was in dire distress...",
