["dlgRaidIntro1"]="Are you trying to correct your mistake? You opened the Gates, but only the Eternals can eliminate the Shadow contagion. Not being one of us, you are weak.",
["dlgRaidIntro2"]="You shall die, like all the rest. Magma flows through my veins, and it will cover all the land, cleansing it for new life.",
["dlgRaidStory1"]="What cellar is this and what are we doing here?",
["dlgRaidStory2"]="This is the antechamber of the Eternals' domain. Their slumber lasted for millennia, but the Gates of Shadows have put the world in peril. They've awakened.",
["dlgRaidStory3"]="Cool – that means they’ll help us deal with the Gates quick and easy!",
["dlgRaidStory4"]="Oh, no. They shall destroy the Gates, but they shall also destroy the whole of mankind. For them it’s only another cycle of destruction and creation.",
["dlgVolcanoGreetings"]="Of all the Eternals, I was the first to awaken. Many fighters will come to die by my hand; I shall complete my mission.",
["dlgVolcanoWin"]="I have been telling my brethren that it is my duty to decide the planet’s destiny. Watch, unbelievers, as my blaze blankets the land!",
["dlgVolcanoLost"]="Enough! I concede. But know this: you have roused my brother. Be not deceived by his appearance, for he is quick and deadly!",
["dlgVolcanoStory1"]="I saw some half-ruined dwellings and a huge statue. Are there humans living here?",
["dlgVolcanoStory2"]="Only fanatics. They worship the Eternals in hope to be spared. Truly, they are blind in their faith. If we fail, they will soon learn the truth.",
["dlgMegalithGreetings"]="This mine is a sacred place. Why are you here? Leave and meet your destiny with honor. The last thing you will hear is the earth trembling beneath your feet.",
["dlgMegalithWin"]="I've treated humans kindly, a rare trait among the Eternals. I helped your species many times. So run and say your last goodbyes to your dear ones!",
["dlgMegalithLost"]="Damnation! Shall I have to wait for thousands of years again? I've moved continents! Cleansing the earth was my role!",
["dlgMegalithStory1"]="My great-grandfather told me of the Eternals fighting for the right to hurl their retribution upon mankind. We are now in the middle of their war.",
["dlgFungusGreetings"]="You have poisoned the land, and now my mushrooms are dying. They shall absorb your mind, and we shall all be one, human. That will be the end of your story!",
["dlgFungusWin"]="Begone! And revel in the last minutes of your fragile lives!",
["dlgFungusLost"]="My brethren have forgotten themselves playing gods. Worship makes them soft. But destruction is in humanity's nature; the world will be better without you.",
["dlgFungusStory1"]="Floods, fires, earthquakes – these were all works of their hands! I am starting to see the whole thing clearly…",
["dlgFungusStory2"]="In a way, it’s a shame we dealt with him so easily. I wish I could see what a mushroom armageddon looks like.",
["dlgVortexGreetings"]="Dark waters will engulf the earth and the Gates of Shadows! Their secret will be lost in the abyss. And there will be no one left on the surface to tell it!",
["dlgVortexWin"]="For thousands of years I’ve watched the withering of your kind. There is some beauty in it. I think I shall keep you alive – just for fun.",
["dlgVortexLost"]="For the first time in thousand years a human wins. Your will to live is so strong! But whatever you do, the end shall be the same: you will die.",
["dlgVortexStory1"]="I pray you tell us, o most ancient one, does not mankind have a chance to atone for its sins against you?",
["dlgVortexStory2"]="Your fate is already decided, you only choose the way in which your lives shall end. But the decision belongs not to me, but to the one who knows no mercy.",
["dlgVortexStory3"]="We have been dealing with humans for so long that we've learned to understand you. But the one who rules us had no such desire. You will soon know that.",
["dlgFatumGreetings"]="Your courage can be only matched by your folly. But I knew that you shall come, for you are my fate, and I am yours. I shall rewrite your destinies – forever.",
["dlgFatumStory1"]="Be cautious, hero. This deep, the universal laws that you’re used to cease to work...",
["dlgFatumStory2"]="That`s right! Hold the boy on the leash. I know all about your destinies: who you are, and where you are going. Shall I tell you who dies in the end?",
["dlgFatumWin"]="Your fate is solved. You have already lost once you've set foot on my abode’s threshold. Will you have enough courage to rewrite your story?",
["dlgFatumLost"]="I know mankind. You walk up and down the same spiral. I’ve seen that more than once. Self-destruction and withering. Nothing can change that. Such is your fate.",
["dlgFatumWin2"]="The Maker is more skilled in weaving the threads of fate than me. He is testing your kin, for he wants a decent rival.{br}Go, human. Suffer his ire.",
["dlgArkhosGreetings"]="Blind fanatics! You remember me and feed me with your faith in the Father. A parent can be strict, and you'll accept my punishment with gratitude...",
["dlgArkhosStory1"]="I know his kind. They gather adepts whom they feed with lies. Don't listen to his firebrand preaching, for that is his primary weapon.",
["dlgArkhosStory2"]="Wrong, old man. I have some hard iron for the refractory children, too. You will be praying me to let you join the family... but I shall be implacable.",
["dlgArkhosWin"]="Black sheep, you are unworthy of a place by my side. Begone! I shall send word to the Creator of how you men have failed again, and he shall feed my children.",
["dlgArkhosLost"]="Whom shall I worship in this last hour of mine? O Creator, why hast thou forsaken me? Thou gave me power to lead them, but I have failed thee... again.",
["dlgHoaxenGreetings"]="All your life is only an illusion. And we are its creators. We shall drive you mad while others count upon brute force. Fire, water, diseases - hah!",
["dlgHoaxenStory1"]="\"We\"? Shadow, it seems like our foe is off his head. Excuse me, which of your personalities are we talking with? Perhaps your \"brother\" could be more rational?",
["dlgHoaxenStory2"]="Laughing at us, human? My brother suggests your souls to be sent to the abyss of eternal misery... Then your world shall yield, without a single drop of blood.",
["dlgHoaxenWin"]="I would've killed you, for my mercy is truly boundless. But my brother is less tolerant; you're free to go, in case if you don't lose your wits on the way out.",
["dlgHoaxenLost"]="Where are you, brother? I can't hear your voice anymore! Truly, being locked all alone is worse than fire or blade... Go, stupid ones. The Father is waiting.",
["Unknown_boss"]="???",
