["SetUiMonk_Title"]="SET OF MONK",
["SetUiMonk_Text"]="Collect and wear the complete gear set with {0} property to get the Tempest Rage.",
["SetUiMonk_Brief"]="Deliver hits, and your power will increase. It will descend if you get hit. Accumulate enough power to land a deadly blow.",
