["RAIDBOSS_PUPPETEER_TITLE"]="Puppeteer",
["RAIDBOSS_PUPPETEER"]="PUPPETEER",
["tutorial_ascension_intro1"]="What an interesting face! Ever thought of being a stage actor? My theater is always in need of actors. Come and try! For a handsome compensation, of course....",
["tutorial_ascension_intro2_1"]="Here's a backstage pass. It's not far from here - you should come! For a victory you get the opportunity to try your luck.",
["tutorial_ascension_intro2_2"]="Acquired {0} {1}.",
["tutorial_ascension_intro2_3"]="But here's the catch: you must collect all pieces of my magic gear during the play. In that case I'll allow you to go further.",
["tutorial_ascension_loss1"]="If you're not interested, then you could join the Raid forces. I heard they were searching for talented fighters. You'll also find my magic gear there.",
["tutorial_ascension_reminder"]="Don't forget, friend: a unique performance opportunity with a prize drawing awaits!",
["ZONE_2Asc_Intro_1"]="Our story is of sacrifice and a curse. A monk once lived in the forest, praying and protecting wayfarers from robbers and dark forces.",
["ZONE_2Asc_Intro_2"]="The simple folk loved the monk for all he did! But a petty, jealous king ordered his death and erected a statue in his own honor.",
["ZONE_2Asc_Intro_3"]="The narrow-minded monarch could never imagine what his greedy, rash actions would cause...  Without the monk, the forest was alive - and hungry again.",
["ZONE_2Asc_Intro_4"]="But there is a hero - and that is you, my friend - who will reassemble the murdered monk’s armor and take his place. His spirit will help you. Now go!",
["tutorial_ascension_immunity_fail"]="Though you have lost, your immunity has become stronger. Next time you will fight better.",
["tutorial_ascension_immunity_fail_2"]="Do not yield to despair: take this pass, and try again.",
["tutorial_ascension_immunity_win"]="You have won! And your immunity has become stronger, so that you can fight even better in your following fights. ",
["Ascension_chest_tooltip"]="Better chests mean better awards!",
["tutorial_ascension_SetUi"]="More details about the gear set and the new available property.",
["tutorial_ascension_MonkPower"]="All the gear you are wearing has the same property, and it is now actived.",
["AscDefeatPrase_1"]="Your acting is not convincing! I don't believe you! Try again, please. Do you have any tickets left?",
["AscDefeatPrase_2"]="You call that acting? It was amateur, at best! Next time I expect much more from you.",
["AscDefeatPrase_3"]="Perhaps I should have given you a walk-on part instead. Nevermind though, a good director can turn any ham into a real actor!",
["AscDefeatPrase_4"]="What's the matter? Is this part above your skills? Come on, you should brace yourself. Try again!",
["AscDefeatPrase_5"]="I suppose it could have been worse. You could have stumbled and broken your leg when you heard the prompt-bell.",
["lottery_text"]="You're free to leave, but if you stay - you can get more valuable prizes. Pay rubies and spin the wheel.",
["dlgLotteryClose"]="EXIT",
["dlgLotteryContinue"]="RETURN",
["AscWinPrase_1"]="What can I say? You're simply... wonderful! Please, do not neglect us. Come again, more and more.",
["AscWinPrase_2"]="Theater - that's what you were born for, my friend! I want to see you on the stage as often as I can. Please come to me again!",
["AscWinPrase_3"]="It would have been a sin to bury such a talent as yours! You truly belong here, with us, on the stage. Please come again, we shall be waiting!",
["AscWinPrase_4"]="Your talent is worthy of all the world's gold! But... the stage itself is the best award. Though I still have some prizes for you, too. So please come again!",
["AscWinPrase_5"]="Oh yes, what we have seen was a true drama! Bravo! You are the brightest of my stars! And the show must go on. The stage is waiting for you!",
