["dlgNewCurrencyPack"]="You can now purchase more coins for the same price.",
["tutorial_begin_1"]="Well, well... my vain disciple has returned. And without a body it seems. How unfortunate for you.",
["tutorial_begin_2"]="You're nothing more than a shadow now. And yet, I sense great power within you. I wonder...",
["tutorial_move"]="Let me see you move! Show me what a shadow can do.",
["tutorial_punchbag"]="Fascinating... Now, see that punching bag? Attack it!",
["tutorial_move_switch"]="Let me see you move! Show me what a shadow can do. {0}",
["tutorial_punchbag_switch"]="Fascinating... Now, see that punching bag? Attack it! Use your arm punch {0} or leg kick {1}",
["tutorial_training_fight"]="Impressive... but a bag cannot defend itself. Let's see how you fare against my disciple, Kenji.",
["tutorial_shop"]="I knew you could do it. Now you need to find yourself a weapon.",
["tutorial_buy_knives"]="In this form you can't die. Thus I suggest you challenge one of the demons now: Lynx!",
["tutorial_map"]="I know where you can find him. Open your map.",
["tutorial_bodyguard_win_2"]="Do you think you can beat them all? You're welcome to try. Until then do not bother me!",
["tutorial_girl_hello"]="Hi, my name is May. I'm the local weapons and armor expert. The best in these climes. Can I work with you?",
["tutorial_girl_please"]="Please, please, please...",
["tutorial_girl_end"]="Good decision! I swear that your gear will always be in perfect condition – and I'll help you with any other problems.",
["tutorial_girl_tournament_1"]="And here's my first advice. You can earn money in tournaments.",
["tutorial_girl_tournament_2"]="With each stage your opponents get stronger and your prize bigger.",
["tutorial_girl_duel_1"]="Duels can be fought once every 4 hours. In Duels you have to use equipment given to you instead of your own.",
["tutorial_girl_duel_2"]="Random rules will be applied to Duels from now on.",
["tutorial_tournament_fail_1"]="I know another way to earn a few coins!",
["tutorial_tournament_fail_2"]="In Survival you fight against numerous opponents. Try it!",
["tutorial_tournament_fail_3"]="The more opponents you defeat, the bigger the prize.",
["tutorial_bodyguard_fail_1"]="I'm afraid, you can't beat Brick without better equipment.",
["tutorial_bodyguard_fail_2"]="Attend the tournament and collect coins to buy better weapons and armor. You can do it!",
["tutorial_buy_armor_1"]="Oh! Looks like you've been beaten? Your equipment is useless in this tournament.",
["tutorial_buy_armor_2"]="It's time for you to buy some affordable armor in the store.",
["tutorial_buy_armor_3"]="As I said, you shouldn't fight without a decent armor!",
["tutorial_buy_armor_4"]="Listen, I can't let you go without reliable equipment.",
["tutorial_buy_helmet_1"]="Oh my God! Look at that huge bump on your head. You can't go on without a helmet.",
["tutorial_buy_helmet_2"]="Now you have enough coins to buy one. Maybe it's time to visit the store?",
["tutorial_girl_winn_tournament_1"]="You are awesome! Earn coins in the tournament so you can buy new gear and defeat Lynx's bodyguards.",
["sensei_lynx_advice"]="Lynx is stronger than he looks! You should prepare yourself and consider upgrading your outfit before challenging him.",
["lynx_after_fifth_guard"]="What weak fighters I had. Thank you for opening my eyes. Eh... as always, I'll do it all by myself.",
["dlgRangedAvailable"]="Hey, look! Now you can purchase these Throwing Knives. I can hardly wait to see you hurling them!",
["dlgMagicAvailable"]="At last this magnificent magic is in your reach! How about scorching something right away?",
["endzone1_sensei_3"]="He he... by the time you are victorious I think I will be long gone...",
["endzone1_sensei_4"]="In any case, good luck.",
["endzone1_newland_1"]="Oh, I can't believe my eyes! The craftsmanship is really better and prices are lower in this province!",
["endzone1_newland_2"]="Well, go ahead! I can't wait to see this gear in action!",
["upgrades_unlocked"]="I know an excellent blacksmith who can upgrade any gear. Use the \"Upgrade\" button in the store.",
["zone2_guard1_defeated_1"]="Hermit only speaks to those who possesses real talent.",
["zone2_guard1_defeated_2"]="You can prove said talent only if you defeat all of his disciples.",
["tutorial_challenge"]="I found a new way to earn coins! You can accept the Challenge and fight in battles with special rules.",
["tutorial_about_claws_1"]="Do you remember Lynx' weapon? He was armed with long claws, one of their kind! Oh, it would be great to get them.",
["tutorial_about_claws_2"]="You can fight him again any time you want.",
["zone2_guard5_defeat"]="Well, well... You are a strong fighter... He he... Perhaps you've earned some free lessons from me.",
["endzone2_girl_admire"]="Hey, we're moving on! You are so amazing! I can't stop admiring you!",
["tutorial_difficulty_notice"]="Are you sure? This battle has an Impossible difficulty. This means that you have no chance to win now.",
["zone3_guard1_defeated_1"]="Ain't ya a tough one, hey? Well, ya still too boring for the Butcher.",
["zone3_guard1_defeated_2"]="But his boys will surely provide you with some entertainment, know what I'm saying?",
["zone3_guard5_defeat"]="What's that? Another shadow? I wonder, do shadows bleed...",
["endzone3_girl_1"]="You are finally finished with those thugs! What a relief...",
["zone4_wasp_greetings_1"]="You are here already? There are rumours of your journey, you know. But if you expect to fight me – I'm going to disappoint you.",
["zone4_wasp_greetings_2"]="Unfortunately, I no longer possess the seal you are looking for. It's been stolen from me several months ago and I've heard nothing of it ever since then.",
["zone4_thief_greetings_1"]="Many apologies, but I happened to hear you speaking with Wasp. I understand there is certain object you wish to obtain.",
["zone4_thief_greetings_2"]="Let's say, there is a friend of mine who knows something of this object's whereabouts.",
["zone4_thief_greetings_3"]="I dare suggest he would happily give this object away to a person able to clear this harbour of Wasp's vile crew.",
["zone4_thief_greetings_4"]="Defeat Wasp's men – and I'll give the seal to you.",
["zone4_guard1_defeated_1"]="Kraken has lost and his ship is under my command now. Great team we are, right?",
["zone4_guard1_defeated_2"]="But Wasp has other men, you know. Off you go!",
["zone4_guard4_defeated_1"]="So slow you are. I expected you to be finished by now. Be quick, I didn't hire you to just stand here!",
["zone4_guard4_defeated_2"]="Take over Skipper's frigate and defeat Wasp. You'll get no payment before that.",
["wasp_beaten"]="Everything is lost – all thanks to you. I guess I stayed in one place for too long. Getting rusty.",
["thief_goodbye_1"]="Wonderful! I am now the only considerable force in these lands. Ah, it's tempting to keep you in my service...",
["thief_goodbye_2"]="But it seems like it's not a healthy habit – having you as an enemy. Here, take the seal.",
["thief_goodbye_3"]="I hope I can count on you if I will ever need a helping hand. Goodbye.",
["zone5_guard1_defeated_1"]="I've long forgotten what it's like to fail in combat. You are clearly different from all those peasant fools. Who do you think has caused all this mayhem? Us? Ha!",
["zone5_guard1_defeated_2"]="We aren't savages. Unlike those simpletons raging furiously at each other in futile hope that Widow's grace will fall upon them.",
["zone5_guard4_defeated_1"]="Hello again! I've decided to repay you for your services back in the harbor. After all, I owe you one.",
["zone5_guard4_defeated_2"]="Besides, surprisingly, not all citizens were quite happy about my empowerment. I'm afraid they've even become a little angered by it.",
["zone5_guard4_defeated_3"]="So I figured that I could use some kind of protection. Against the angry mob, you know. You won't mind, do you?",
["widow_beaten"]="To hell with you! Take the seal and let demons tear you apart at the Gate of Shadows!",
["thief_congrat"]="What a delightful power demonstration! This gives me an idea or two... well, nevermind. I trust we can now get out of this terribly depressing place?",
["endzone5_girl_1"]="We've almost reached the Gate of Shadows now. But I'm afraid of what's waiting ahead...",
["Ambush1400_title"]="AMBUSH!",
["Ambush1400_announce"]="Surrender your possessions or die!",
["Ambush1400_over"]="Looks like they've lost their spirit! I suppose they'll think twice before attacking again.",
