["intermission_stranger_1_challenge"]="By the mercenaries' code of honor I must give away my weapon in case of my loss. But I'm very good at my trade!",
["intermission_stranger_1_reject"]="Coward! Can't believe I've wasted my time on you. What a disgrace!",
["intermission_stranger_1_greetings"]="I've been watching you for all that time. You're going pretty well, so I'm obliged to stop you now. I've been warned about your skill by my master.",
["intermission_stranger_1_rematch_offer"]="I've managed to find out how much she's been paid for your head. Nova doesn't care who pays, and we don't need any gossip about your loss...",
["intermission_stranger_1_challenge_again"]="So you wish to try once more? That's the spirit!",
["intermission_stranger_1_rematch_warning"]="We shouldn't let her go! She's going to tell everything to her master... I fear the one who hired her is related to Titan somehow.",
["intermission_stranger_1_drop"]="Accepting her defeat, Nova hands over her knuckles as she promised.",
