["zone6_start_dialog_may_1"]="How strange... We've traveled so many days, and yet there are no signs of life. No people, no animals, no trees... Nothing but a huge wasteland.",
["zone6_start_dialog_sensei_1"]="This land is close to the Gates of Shadows and has suffered greatly. I remember fertile plains once surrounded the great Ivory City...",
["zone6_start_dialog_may_2"]="Look! That glow in the distance – it’s the Ivory City! It's burning! How can that be? It's supposed to be full of people! Can we still help them?",
["zone6_guard1_greetings"]="You, there – halt! If you drop your weapons and come out where I can see, I promise you a swift and painless death.",
["zone6_guard1_defeated_1"]="You... The Prince! But... But, you should be dead! It's impossible! Troops, fall back!",
["zone6_guard1_defeated_2"]="Interesting... This fool seems to think you are some 'prince'. I think you should play along.",
["zone6_guard2_greetings_1"]="Look, Captain! There he is, just as I said! The Prince has returned from the grave!",
["zone6_guard2_greetings_2"]="Coward! I should have hanged you long ago. Step aside, so that I may deal with this beggar and prove he is no Prince.",
["zone6_guard2_defeated_1"]="Mercy, o Prince! I will leave this city; I’ll never take up a weapon again, only spare my worthless life. Please, my lord!",
["zone6_guard2_defeated_2"]="A Prince, huh? Have you been keeping secrets from us?",
["zone6_guard2_defeated_3"]="No, this is obviously a case of mistaken identity. But, if they fear him, it is all the better.",
["zone6_guard3_greetings"]="So, you are the impostor who pretends to be my master! Your deceit insults his memory. For that, you will pay!",
["zone6_guard3_defeated_1"]="Forgive me for doubting you, my Prince. I fear Shogun's lies have entangled my mind.",
["zone6_guard3_defeated_2"]="Tell us more about Shogun.",
["zone6_guard4_defeated"]="My defeat will do you no good, monster. Shogun knows you are here. Whatever you are planning, he will stop you...",
["zone_6_quest_fight_won"]="Ha-ha! That was the fastest running away I've seen in a while. That'll show you, losers!",
["zone6_shogun_greetings_1"]="So... Here you are, after all of these years. What took you so long? Have you found another realm to ruin with your greed and incompetence?",
["zone6_shogun_greetings_2"]="I see my assassins haven't failed completely. You're only a shadow of the Prince I knew.",
["zone6_shogun_won"]="Did you really think you could match my power? I have conquered countless lands! Enslaved whole nations! Even Kings bow before me!",
["zone6_shogun_defeated_1"]="No... This is impossible... I am invincible! I cannot lose, not now! And you... you think you can take my empire away from me? Hah!",
["zone6_shogun_defeated_3"]="Well done, my disciple. You now have all six Seals needed to close the Gates. But don't celebrate just yet. First, we must reach the Gates...",
["shadow_gates_greetings_1"]="Long time no see, Shadow. You didn't think we would just disappear, did you?",
["shadow_gates_greetings_2"]="It's six against one this time. You will never reach the Gates!",
["shadow_gates_greetings_3"]="When we're done with him, I get whatever is left of his body!",
["shadow_gates_defeated_1"]="We were the strongest warriors who ever lived and yet we failed to defeat you...",
["shadow_gates_defeated_2"]="You don't belong to this world. No one is that powerful...",
["shadow_gates_defeated_3"]="Don't think you've seen the last of us. We'll meet again soon, Shadow. Until then, enjoy your victory.",
["shadow_gates_defeated_4"]="Finally, we have reached the Gates of Shadows... The sight of it is hard to bear. You have everything you need to close them forever, except for one thing.",
["shadow_gates_defeated_5"]="Only those made of flesh and bone can use the Seals. I would gladly do it if I were not so old. I can still shatter a brick wall with my fist, but my life energy is draining fast.",
["shadow_gates_defeated_6"]="Hey, don't look at me! I like you guys, but there is no profit in dying or becoming another shadow. Good luck though!",
["im_begin_1"]="May! No, this cannot be! Something has gone terribly wrong!",
["im_begin_2"]="An unexpected turn of events... I'm truly sorry about your friend, Shadow.",
["im_begin_3"]="This was a bad idea from the start. But now, we must open the Gates once more to save May. Any ideas?",
["im_begin_4"]="The Seals! Each one appears to be connected to its owner somehow. We should revisit each owner – perhaps we will learn how to break the Seals.",
["im_begin_5"]="What? Are you serious?.. Oh, what am I saying – of course you're serious... Well, Lynx is first in line, so I guess we should start there.",
["im_lynx_greetings"]="So, you're back. You expect me to just sit here while you open the Gates? No, I can't let you do that! Not again!",
["im_lynx_defeated"]="Ah! The voice! I still hear Titan's voice inside my head! You don't understand the power you're dealing with. You've doomed us all!",
["im_hermit_greetings"]="Everyone was so afraid of my magic, but there are far more powerful forces at work here – things we don't understand, but we know they should be feared.",
["im_hermit_defeated"]="Do not think that you can fully comprehend Titan's powers! He can change one's thoughts, feelings, and memories! How do you fight that?",
["im_butcher_greetings"]="You think I'm the monster? You haven't seen what Titan does to his enemies... I have, and it sickens even me.",
["im_butcher_defeated"]="Why do you persist? No one wants you to open the Gates. Someone will be strong enough to stop you!",
["im_wasp_defeated"]="Believe me, you do not want to see what lies beyond the Gates. Forget your friend; it's not too late to turn back!",
["im_widow_greetings"]="Titan's minions are like nothing you've ever seen before. You think you're prepared? It's never enough!",
["im_widow_defeated"]="Titan's been leading you from the very beginning! Pulling your strings like a puppet master. Even now you do what he wishes.",
["im_shogun_greetings"]="Until Titan finds the way through the Gates, this is my realm, and I will not allow you to take it from me!",
["im_shogun_defeated"]="Why do you hasten your own demise? Leave now and enjoy what little time your world has left before Titan destroys you all.",
["im_ending_1"]="Now that they're taken care of, what's next?",
["im_ending_2"]="Now it is up to Shadow. He has the tools and the experience. He is finally ready.",
["im_ending_3"]="This is suicide. I know May is your friend... but do you really want to do this?",
["im_ending_4"]="You must go! There is no time for debate. It is now or never!",
["im_ending_5"]="No matter what happens, it was an honor to travel with you, Shadow.",
["im_ending_6"]="Have no fear, my apprentice. Your heart is pure, your resolve is strong. Trust in yourself and your training, and you cannot fail.",
["Act_2"]="Act II{br}Secret Path",
["Act_4"]="Act IV{br}Pirate Throne",
