["endzone1_girl_come_along"]="I've always dreamed of excitement and adventure. What are we standing around for? Let's go!",
["endzone1_sensei_1"]="Ah, the first Seal. Well done, Shadow. Only five Seals left. Come, we must hurry!",
["endzone1_sensei_2"]="My apprentice is missing. I'm worried for his safety. He left to try the new schools in the next town, but I have not heard from him since.",
["Error"]="ERROR",
["FULL_DESCRIPTION_ENEMY_STRIKES_HARD"]="Enemy attacks are much more powerful than yours.",
["FULL_DESCRIPTION_RANGED_LEVEL_RESTRICTION"]="You can only fight if your ranged weapon is level {0} or higher.",
["GetFree"]="GET FREE",
["hermit_beaten_1"]="You are very skilled for one so young. I will share my secret with you, but you must complete a task in return.",
["hermit_beaten_2"]="Butcher, the gang leader in the nearby village, threatens me. He wants my magic. Get rid of him and you'll have earned my favor.",
["hermit_beaten_3"]="Now go and sow destruction!",
["hermit_beaten_4"]="You have shown great skill, Shadow. I trust that you can wield this magic for good. But do not allow it to tempt you or taint your good heart.",
["hermit_beaten_5"]="Great! I can't wait to see this. How about we find some targets to practice your new power on?",
["im_wasp_greetings"]="You tempt Titan with your meddling! We don't know where he came from, only that he is... different. He creates strange things to serve him...",
["Interlude"]="Interlude",
["lynx_beaten"]="No! It cannot be... All the glory of the Order within your grasp, but you only seek the Seal?",
["lynx_beaten2"]="Fine! You have won your precious trinket. Be gone from my sight, but be warned: I will not forget what you have done!",
["lynx_won"]="Ha! You can't beat me, Shadow. Why do you even try?",
["redirect"]="Go",
["SCORE_CONTEST_INVERTED_JOYSTICK"]="Score victory, inverted movement",
["shadow_gates_defeated_7"]="So I'm the only one left? Sensei, Sly, come on! This is no time to fear for your own skin!",
["shadow_gates_defeated_8"]="No?.. Fine! Be like that! Nobody needs your help anyway! Let's go, Shadow!",
["SuccessTitle"]="CONGRATULATIONS!",
["tutorial_bodyguard_win_1"]="I'm the leader of the Assassin's Order; you are not worthy of fighting me! At least your \"battle\" with Shin was entertaining.",
["tutorial_boss_hello"]="Who is this lowly worm before me? I'll not waste my time fighting the likes of you.",
["tutorial_boss_hello2"]="Here's Shin, the weakest apprentice in my Order. First, defeat him... if you can. Perhaps then will you have the honor of fighting me.",
["wasp_beaten_1"]="What have I done? Widow said everyone would kneel to me if I agreed to help her!",
["wasp_beaten_2"]="She said betraying my father was the only way to show men that women should rule.",
["wasp_beaten_3"]="This is not our war, but I am curious about Widow.",
["wasp_beaten_4"]="Me too! She’s obviously a worthy opponent. Let’s pay her a visit, shall we?",
["widow_beaten_1"]="How does it feel to defeat a woman? And you're the one who'll close the Gates of Shadows? You have no idea how quickly their power will tear you apart!",
["widow_beaten_2"]="I'm feeling a bit... dizzy. Widow's spell turned me into a weak-willed, love-sick maniac! Thanks for saving me. I owe you a big one.",
["widow_beaten_3"]="She's really freaking me out, guys! She's right though. I feel like something dark and terrifying is yet to come. We need to be careful!",
["widow_beaten_4"]="Stay focused. The Gates of Shadows are close. There may be strange, frightening things ahead for us, but we must not fail.",
["ZONE_2"]="Secret Path",
["ZONE_4"]="Pirate Throne",
["zone1_guard2_defeated"]="I... I don't understand. How could one so small defeat me?",
["zone1_guard2_greetings"]="Such an insignificant creature like you is hardly a challenge for me. Prepare to be crushed, little man!",
["zone1_guard3_defeated"]="I am defeated? Impossible! The Order will not ignore this outrage! You will be hunted and punished, Shadow!",
["zone1_guard3_greetings"]="There's nowhere for you to run, nowhere to hide. The Order will stop at nothing to defeat you.",
["zone1_guard3_greetings2"]="But that won't be necessary, for I shall land the killing blow and bring honor to my Master!",
["zone1_guard4_defeated"]="My defeat only serves to strengthen Lynx. With each battle he learns more of your moves, your skill, and thus, how to defeat you.",
["zone1_guard4_greetings"]="I beat Lynx easily the first time I fought him. However, when I removed his mask I saw only a dummy.",
["zone1_guard4_greetings2"]="Then I felt his claws digging into the back of my neck. I have served him ever since.",
["zone1_guard5_defeated"]="I've grown bored of this life, the Order. I wish to return to my true place, my seat of high power. But don't think that Lynx will be so easy. He will not fail!"}
